<title>INDIA: Nomura to buy stake in Indian mutual fund.</title>
<headline>Nomura to buy stake in Indian mutual fund.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Nomura Securities Co Ltd will buy a 40 percent stake in India's state-run UTI Securities, the Press Trust of India (PTI) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The news agency quoted official sources as saying it was the first time a major Japanese securities firm was making a major investment in an Indian mutual fund firm.</p>
</text>
